{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22148","headline":"渭上偶钓 · 白居易","name":"渭上偶钓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭水如镜色，中有鲤与鲂。\n偶持一竿竹，悬钓在其傍。\n微风吹钓丝，嫋嫋十尺长。\n谁知对鱼坐，心在无何乡。\n昔有白头人，亦钓此渭阳。\n钓人不钓鱼，七十得文王。\n况我垂钓意，人鱼又兼忘。\n无机两不得，但弄秋水光。\n兴尽钓亦罢，归来饮我觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}